<!--
  Intentional framework differences established by #2573 and retained for .NET 8:
  - .NET 8 and .NET Standard keep collection and serializer contracts compatible.
  - .NET 10 retains IReadOnlySet and ref-struct protocol contracts.
  - Modern enums inherit runtime-provided ISpanFormattable.
  - SkipLocalsInit metadata differs between the modern and .NET Standard writers.
  The SDK compares adjacent compatible assets: netstandard2.0 to net8.0, then
  net8.0 to net10.0. Each suppression names its exact target and asset pair.
  Released-package baseline breaks are not suppressed. Remove entries when assets converge.
-->
